{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Wisdom 17 or higher\n\nBy following a strict routine, you’ve become accustomed to resting less than others, gaining the following benefits.\n\n- Increase your Wisdom score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- You gain the full benefits of taking a short or long rest in half the normal amount of time. If you sleep, you must expend all your time of the rest sleeping for this benefit to take in effect.\n\n- Whenever you finish a short rest you reduce one level of exhaustion on yourself and eliminate one effect causing your hit point maximum to be reduced.\n\n- Whenever you finish a long rest, you gain advantage on the first saving throw, attack roll or ability check you make before the start of your next long rest.","level":1}],"id":"Custom79a9855e-f9ed-49fc-95f2-7fc4aed7a151","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Early Riser [VSS] [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}